# The Drishti Lake Python wheel this Drishti pins: the one place its version is written (tools/lake/lakewheel.py reads it; a test holds
# drishti-console/requirements.txt to it). It is built from the Lake commit below (Lake 0.9.1), and the build is reproducible (the same bytes every
# time). When Lake tags v0.9.1 the ref moves from the commit to the tag; the content does not change.
#
# To get it (Linux, macOS, Windows; needs uv, https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):
#     git clone https://github.com/ajsinha/drishti-lake.git && git -C drishti-lake checkout 336524bf898c8cf3c66a2ee41c9dd8b5593ec7dc
#     uv build --wheel drishti-lake/python --out-dir <drishti home>/lib/wheels
# or take it from the release bundle into <drishti home>/lib/wheels. Then `python tools/lake/lakewheel.py` checks it.
ref=336524bf898c8cf3c66a2ee41c9dd8b5593ec7dc
version=0.9.1
sha256=81241d9c46b196d722ac2e006ee3c0712de60ba7183addd4ca18b29a85f60a16
